window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A dagger that burns instead of drawing blood. A family secret too dangerous to repeat. A promise to save someone she loves.</b></p> <p>Nova is flung into a world of magic, secrets, and sky pirates. Now, she must depend on two men to help her find the way out. One wants her dead, the other would follow her anywhere.</p> <p>But there's legendary magic in the mix, and it's dangerous. They must work together in order to survive, but which one is planning to betray them all?</p> <p>Pick up the first book in the Djinn Kingdom by <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author LJ Andrews, because you love a girl who can hold her own.</p> <p><b>Get it now.</b></p>"; 
